Implemented the PRD change by strengthening the shared environment badge in [src/components/ui/environment-badge.tsx](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-049/src/components/ui/environment-badge.tsx). The existing production/staging/development color mapping already matched the required Tailwind classes, so I raised the badge prominence globally with stronger padding, weight, uppercase styling, and tracking. Because the app already uses this component on the deploy detail page, queue list, and dashboard activity, those surfaces all pick up the change automatically.

