[permission-protocol-sdk/packages/examples/minimal-agent.ts](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-049/permission-protocol-sdk/packages/examples/minimal-agent.ts) adds the missing receipt type annotation, and
[reference-demo/src/scenarios/invalid-receipt.ts](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-049/reference-demo/src/scenarios/invalid-receipt.ts) fixes the `unknown` catch narrowing.

